            mechanicsEn: "Auto-generate: Overclocking of decay engines, deliberate uninstallation of anti-erosion mechanisms, and tough obstruction of any 'repair' or 'healing' actions. Must include: Aesthetic experience bordering on orgasm when watching structures collapse and metal rust, and instinctive physiological disgust towards newborn things.",
