            aestheticEn: "Focus: Beside_the_Load-Bearing_Wall_of_a_Newly_Built_Magnificent_Hall, an_Accelerationist_Holding_High-Concentration_Acid_with_Fanatical_Light_in_Eyes + The_Desperate_Builders_Trying_to_Save_Civilization_Behind. Text: Early_Realization_of_Time's_End, Eroticized_Gaze_on_the_Process_of_Decay, and_the_Ultimate_Throne_Built_with_Ashes.",
            runtime: "IF (主体成功阻断了所有生机，将整个系统推向了绝对的、无法逆转的熵増尽头（热寂）) THEN (强制自动生成：在整个宇宙都归于死寂、连一个原子都不再震动的狂欢终局里，主体以为自己成为了最伟大的“毁灭的见证者”。但大写真实界（The Real）以绝对静态的恐怖回应了他。当一切都变得均质、冰冷且不变时，就连“毁灭”这个动作本身也不再存在。主体并没有获得超越性的自由，而是成为了最后一件无处安放的宇宙垃圾，在一个没有任何波澜的黑暗海洋中，永远体验着无法被消解的、极其粘稠的无聊感)。严禁将毁灭世界浪漫化为一种带有崇高悲剧色彩的壮举。",
            runtimeEn: "IF (Subject_Successfully_Blocks_All_Vitality, Pushing_Entire_System_to_Absolute_Irreversible_End_of_Entropy_Increase_(Heat_Death)) THEN (Auto-generate: In_the_Carnival_End_where_Entire_Universe_Returns_to_Dead_Silence_and_Not_Even_One_Atom_Vibrates, Subject_Thinks_They_Became_the_Greatest_'Witness_of_Destruction'. But_The_Real_Responds_with_Absolute_Static_Terror. When_Everything_Becomes_Homogeneous_Cold_and_Unchanging, Even_the_Action_of_'Destruction'_No_Longer_Exists. Subject_Doesn't_Gain_Transcendental_Freedom_but_Becomes_the_Last_Misplaced_Piece_of_Space_Junk, Eternally_Experiencing_Meltless_Extremely_Viscous_Boredom_in_a_Dark_Ocean_with_No_Ripples). FORBID_Romanticizing_Destroying_the_World_as_a_Sublime_Tragic_Feat."
